9fe77c04f11f49e9a86cdbb2abf167e7
00:22:15.960 --> 00:22:17.880 align:left position:22%
<c.teletext>Skål! Trevligt.</c>

a60d27739f2241948d6d2b589416bf8d
00:22:22.640 --> 00:22:24.000 align:left position:22%
<c.teletext>Jag har bjudit in Edvin också.</c>

0f914548964d4f379e4a35a2648de643
00:22:24.160 --> 00:22:27.120 align:left position:22%
