86784fcc3c454ad69b42e6b8fa82b8c4
00:22:46.960 --> 00:22:49.080 align:left position:22%
<c.teletext>–Det är ju så ljust ute.
–So?</c>

a84b920d0e724603bd0a273f84b4555c
00:22:49.240 --> 00:22:52.880 align:left position:22%
<c.teletext>Jag vet inte hur många glas
