a775873c190e4e1e952dc2281611f054
00:23:14.920 --> 00:23:16.680 align:left position:22%
<c.teletext>Ja...</c>

ceb87f91529c43168f0be2dd87fde765
00:23:16.840 --> 00:23:18.840 align:left position:22%
<c.teletext>–Hur länge har du varit singel nu?
–I 1,5 år.</c>

b6825b8aa6bc4331b553a485b1954cfb
00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:22.400 align:left position:22%
<c.teletext>Men 1,5 år... Och under
den här tiden så har du dejtat.</c>

36390fec27b241639dfa2f73dba1307c
00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:25.360 align:left position:22%
<c.teletext>–Ja. Inte så aggressivt.
