0dec36c3de8f4948b13402b8d432e445
00:26:31.160 --> 00:26:32.800 align:left position:22%
<c.teletext>Jag har förstått</c>

40c830aac6fd4c02bb427de756d98237
00:26:32.960 --> 00:26:37.000 align:left position:22%
<c.teletext>att det nog verkligen har skadat
